---
// Footer.astro
---
<footer class="bg-surface border-t border-borderSubtle mt-16 py-8">
  <div class="w-full px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-textSecondary">
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
      <span class="text-accent font-bold">GitActivityNews</span>
      <span>— Arquitetura de Feed Estático no GitHub Pages</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      Compilado para GitHub Pages • Dark Mode (Terracota, Carvão e Off-White)
    </div>
    <a
      href="https://github.com/bramosjr"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="text-textSecondary hover:text-accent transition"
    >
      github.com/bramosjr
    </a>
  </div>
  <p class="w-full px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 mt-4 text-xs text-textSecondary/80 text-center sm:text-left">
    Contagem de visitas anônima via
    <a
      href="https://www.goatcounter.com/privacy"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="underline hover:text-accent transition"
    >GoatCounter</a>
    — sem cookies e sem rastreamento individual.
  </p>
</footer>
